SUMMARY:Steve Flemming's Love Songs that Stir the Soul (Thursday May 28th)
DESCRIPTION:Soul City Social Club (Toronto\, Canada)\nHello everyone\,\n\n
 Please join us **on zoom** for a fun\, relaxing and inspiring evening with
  **Love Songs that Stir the Soul.**\n\nYou will love what you hear! :)\nWo
 nderful new songs every week!\n\n\\*You are welcome to join us any time af
 ter 9:00 pm (Eastern Time)\n\\*You are also welcome to come on later in th
 e evening as well\n**\\*\\*Attend for free if you like - if it's your firs
 t time attending :)**\n\nEvent Details below:\n\nSincerely\,\n\nSteve Flem
 ming\n(Canadian Folk Lyricist)\n\nEvent Details:\n**Steve Flemming's Love 
 Songs that Stir the Soul**\n**(on Zoom)**\n\n\\*Original Lyrics and Songs 
 by Songwriter and Lyricist Steve Flemming\n\n\\*Story songs\, love songs\,
  spiritual songs\, and many other fun surprises!\n\nI'll be playing a mix 
 of songs using a fusion of mixed genres like\, **Folk\, Traditional Folk\,
  Country\, Blue Grass\, Singer Song Writer\, Soft Rock\, Easy Listening\, 
 Classic Rock\, R & B\, Gospel\, Pop\, Adult Contemporary\, Indie Rock/Po**
 p and many others genres too. So please sit back and get ready to have an 
 amazing auditory experience in the comforts of your own home :)\n\n\\*You 
 can come on and off at any time during the night- starting at 9:00 pm\n\n\
 \-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\n**Event Fee:**\n\nFree if it's your first time at
 tending online with me :)\n**Pay What You Can: (P.W.Y.C)**\nYou can kindly
  send through e transfer or pay pal to:\n**steveflemming11@gmail.com**\n\n
 -Anything you can contribute is greatly appreciated to help support this m
 eaningful musical endeavor and song loving community\n\n\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-
 \\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\n**Zoom link:**\
 n\nhttps://us04web.zoom.us/j/495043928\n\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\
 \-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\n\n**Testimonials from Past Events:**\n\n
 Steve Flemming is an amazing songwriter whose lyrics stir the soul. He tra
 nsforms everyday thoughts and life into beautiful poetry and magical tunes
 . Amazing stuff yet again Steve. - L.L.\nSteve\, thank you for a night of 
 heartfelt\, exhilarating\, and inspiring music.\nV.R.\nThanks for having m
 e my friend. I love your words\, they calm me and energize me at the same 
 time I'll look forward to your next invite\nM.Z.\n\\-\\-\\-\\-
